version 3
run Qos-0-20261116-13:02:02-1502
attr configname Qos
attr datetime 20261116-13:02:02
attr datetimef 20261116-130202
attr experiment Qos
attr inifile omnetpp.ini
attr iterationvars ""
attr iterationvarsd ""
attr iterationvarsf ""
attr measurement ""
attr network QosShowcase
attr processid 1502
attr repetition 0
attr replication #0
attr resultdir results
attr runnumber 0
